alse, "text": "Prompt  [Copy]\n/haipipe-cowork: open a job for <need> in <block>", "originalText": "Prompt  [Copy]\n/haipipe-cowork: open a job for <need> in <block>", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_runs-list", "type": "text", "x": 5675.0, "y": 2305.0, "width": 283.5, "height": 65.625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": null, "seed": 398671609, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1086839922, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791128090039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Runs of the picked row\nopen a job         done   ⧉\nupdate a job       done   ⧉", "originalText": "Runs of the picked row\nopen a job         done   ⧉\nupdate a job       done   ⧉", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_runs-note", "type": "text", "x": 5675.0, "y": 2467.5, "width": 441.0, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": null, "seed": 1817521329, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 44387641, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791128090039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Status lives here, never in the table.\nPicking a Job row narrows the list.\nCopy hands the prompt to a session;\nnothing here starts a run or sends a message.", "originalText": "Status lives here, never in the table.\nPicking a Job row narrows the list.\nCopy hands the prompt to a session;\nnothing here starts a run or sends a message.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_ws-notes", "type": "text", "x": 1480.0, "y": 2935.0, "width": 2408.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": null, "seed": 1518708993, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1098883112, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791128090039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A row is one Job. Questions are Logic │ Work │ Report rows whose Work cites Block files; Emails and Meetings are newest first. A job page, a draft, a report and a drawing open in one pop-out. No status in the table.", "originalText": "A row is one Job. Questions are Logic │ Work │ Report rows whose Work cites Block files; Emails and Meetings are newest first. A job page, a draft, a report and a drawing open in one pop-out. No status in the table.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_p3-title", "type": "text", "x": 1450.0, "y": 3172.5, "width": 764.4000000000001, "height": 43.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-folders", "roundness": null, "seed": 915874341, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1578711909, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791128090039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 · Where things live: the Block folder", "originalText": "3 · Where things live: the Block folder", "fontSize": 35, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_tree-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1450.0, "y": 3242.5, "width": 6000.0, "height": 550.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-folders", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 597769866, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 717820829, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791128090039, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_tree", "type": "text", "x": 1490.0, "y": 3277.5, "width": 1365.0, "height": 375.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-folders", "roundness": null, "seed": 258639595, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 680734319, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791128090039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "cowork/bNN_<topic>/\n├── board.md                      header · text · Questions register · Related resources\n├── j00_people/                    who to ask for help (state: 📇 REFERENCE)\n├── jNN_<job>/                     one line of work, usually one request to one office\n│   ├── jNN_<job>.md               header: state · waiting-on · since · next · ticket · url\n│   ├── Timeline.md · CHECKLIST.md dates; numbered steps with their draft messages\n│   └── emails/ · meetings/ · design/ · materials/    only when needed\n├── studio/                        drawings and decks (generated ones by studio/_build/)\n├── reports/qNN_<topic>/           one report Page per Question\n│   ├── qNN_<topic>.md · page.toml\n│   └── runs/                      the Page's own runs (check)\n└── _old/                          replaced material; do not use", "originalText": "cowork/bNN_<topic>/\n├── board.md                      header · text · Questions register · Related resources\n├── j00_people/                    who to ask for help (state: 📇 REFERENCE)\n├── jNN_<job>/                     one line of work, usually one request to one office\n│   ├── jNN_<job>.md               header: state · waiting-on · since · next · ticket · url\n│   ├── Timeline.md · CHECKLIST.md dates; numbered steps with their draft messages\n│   └── emails/ · meetings/ · design/ · materials/    only when needed\n├── studio/                        drawings and decks (generated ones by studio/_build/)\n├── reports/qNN_<topic>/           one report Page per Question\n│   ├── qNN_<topic>.md · page.toml\n│   └── runs/                      the Page's own runs (check)\n└── _old/                          replaced material; do not use", "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_tree-notes", "type": "text", "x": 1490.0, "y": 3822.5, "width": 2344.3, "height": 26.5625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-folders", "roundness": null, "seed": 221646774, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1509407572, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791128090039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Guide's Method and Related Paper live with the skill (haipipe-workbench-cowork/ref/), the same for every Block. Office files, recordings and anything over 5 MB stay local through cowork/.gitignore.", "originalText": "Guide's Method and Related Paper live with the skill (haipipe-workbench-cowork/ref/), the same for every Block. Office files, recordings and anything over 5 MB stay local through cowork/.gitignore.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_frame-skills", "type": "frame", "x": 1400.0, "y": 497.5, "width": 6100.0, "height": 1132.1875, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": 